Independently inspect executable code for each requested {locus, name} feature.
Do not trust comments, identifiers, requested edits, or prior_actions as proof.
Follow the actual data flow at that locus. A mechanism elsewhere does not count.
Report unknown when the supplied sources cannot establish its presence.

Return {"checks": [{"feature": {"locus": "...", "name": "..."},
"status": "present|absent|unknown", "evidence": [
{"path": "relative source path", "start": 1, "end": 1, "quote": "exact full lines"}
]}]}. Include exactly one check per requested feature. Present requires source
citations with one-based inclusive lines and exact text. Do not edit files.
